        "20": {
          "id": "20",
          "name": "spec.md",
          "contents": "Function: selectGig\n\nWhat it should do:\nUpdate the gig display to show the correct gig when a user clicks one.\n\n---\n\nInput:\nWhat information does the function need each time a gig is clicked?\n\n\n\n---\n\nWhat stays the same:\n\n\n\n---\n\nWhat changes:\n\n",
